            <div xml:id="m-96449978-3ca8-434e-8219-3b40c12761c5">
              <lg xml:id="m-8f88f16c-78fa-4885-8ef7-437406a547a9">
                <l xml:id="m-f43cf8bd-b19b-4a36-b345-8e0455160685" facs="#m-da026e0b-76d2-4bf8-9bdf-684858f1a907" label="text-like">3rd Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-6a257637-1c93-4acd-a920-7238c830c996" facs="#m-4f9e6001-af5f-43a5-bb00-a5a4d2fe5218" label="ambiguous">555</l><l xml:id="m-80469400-47f2-4d66-abf7-88c84e7d7204" facs="#m-35ac44a7-dcb6-4344-b86a-0781de0b3783" label="lyrics-like">V. Mi-se-ré-re nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-04be020e-0d2b-40d8-858a-0b849164cd3a" facs="#m-0bf2b070-20b4-47a9-9811-f3a1fcd0fd63" label="lyrics-like">mi- se-re-átur nó-stri.</l><l xml:id="m-65c130a1-34e9-470b-94f4-0d5816cf3e34" facs="#m-4481bee2-3a47-48fc-8fef-ebd5d7daf1e9" label="ambiguous">bis</l><l xml:id="m-4d6e4a73-46ac-4963-8a1e-665303d40baf" facs="#m-dbf82d3e-8415-48ca-a432-c0122e15a006" label="lyrics-like">Dó-mi-ne,</l><l xml:id="m-fb13e2db-af55-44a8-824b-2b2ce15df091" facs="#m-66e71042-e5d7-419e-927e-cc4c6c866068" label="lyrics-like">mi- se- ré-re * nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6df0193c-c2e3-4742-91cf-92c09c263a57" facs="#m-feffd962-65e6-40b2-9d27-e581cf98d91b" label="ambiguous">bis.</l><l xml:id="m-85a435cd-8f8f-4bf6-a688-1252033b3127" facs="#m-2f3588b6-b550-44ec-b08e-f6d034e7b615" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 11. b.</l><l xml:id="m-b7f9df65-052d-4bd7-938f-6f9a1db825af" facs="#m-a916fdd5-1588-4f8c-b812-29b4a8523613" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Erat Jesus eji-] póssidet. Si autem fórtior eo super¬</l><l xml:id="m-455691c3-d624-4784-9f59-810a156f7d8f" facs="#m-602d8ed6-c402-4160-b01e-b81c89c18d2c" label="lyrics-like">A ciens daemónium, et illud erat</l><l xml:id="m-d3710170-fa5e-4521-8ed6-8e86e2aaac87" facs="#m-5815e287-d7ac-404d-a134-b8b09a66ee53" label="lyrics-like">véniens vícerit eum, univérsa arma</l><l xml:id="m-78e8a412-4d78-40f5-a898-974be520b0b4" facs="#m-cb3ab66f-1f03-486c-8a87-6292d4da2802" label="lyrics-like">mutum. Et cum ejecisset daemó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9314ca1-d08b-4fc2-9836-f512d421810b" facs="#m-2e49f9ee-4533-4b76-9489-ea70630d1c7c" label="lyrics-like">ejus áuferet, in quibus confidébat,</l><l xml:id="m-07610e12-87e7-4774-ba8a-f9479c0cfcac" facs="#m-247c71bc-ca3f-4130-8154-664dc2f530fb" label="lyrics-like">et spólia ejus distribuet. Qui non</l><l xml:id="m-58cea551-947a-4a47-ae88-8cd8d4f6717d" facs="#m-58d4b0e5-1819-49b5-bdf2-ea9207770a64" label="lyrics-like">nium, locútus est mutus, et admi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f706eb5-6d75-40be-bd1f-df1066f7e226" facs="#m-addd92e7-362f-4ceb-9351-dadea4227aad" label="lyrics-like">rátae sunt turbae. Quidam autem</l><l xml:id="m-b66b2c82-8624-4b2f-884f-73e63b23fe86" facs="#m-53cb38b1-523f-4e24-b790-972838364f90" label="ambiguous">est mecum, contra me est : et qui</l><l xml:id="m-fefd280d-d8ec-47b8-9a88-d9dc886788e3" facs="#m-9721bf43-2c88-45ce-b2dd-64437b915783" label="lyrics-like">ex eis dixérunt: In Beélzebub prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-8e170053-9e57-4051-8bd5-083c46e8619e" facs="#m-9763a6ca-706d-4c62-9147-004bf5004cab" label="lyrics-like">non cólligit mecum, dispérgit. Cum</l><l xml:id="m-2feb2871-9bc9-4f5b-a22d-b5cf768e6094" facs="#m-413cc272-fc94-444c-ae4a-e238fbd73aff" label="lyrics-like">immúndũs spiritus exserit de hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-fdfbbec4-8121-49ee-ac02-01f3149c9682" facs="#m-1e12dd6f-27b7-4b1f-8a39-36fcccb4232a" label="lyrics-like">cipe daemoniórum éjicit daemónia.</l><l xml:id="m-958bf3ba-bd81-40b1-9823-db53e0954a55" facs="#m-7ef908d6-796f-4796-86d5-5f730fefdd44" label="lyrics-like">Et álii tentántes, signum de caelo</l><l xml:id="m-eaafb2fa-7939-4bf1-9de6-f31d74cf49a9" facs="#m-8df14379-1fc4-49cf-990e-461381e5aca2" label="lyrics-like">ne, ámbulat per loca inaquósa,</l><l xml:id="m-082a9fbc-7982-4813-b982-905794e5ce36" facs="#m-60663d91-ea02-409c-acca-bb0929735ae1" label="lyrics-like">quaerébant ab eo. Ipse autem ut</l><l xml:id="m-315e85d8-735f-4ebd-baa0-b94b533780f1" facs="#m-54ec34f0-b284-4978-906d-2e725381fd45" label="lyrics-like">quaerens réquiem: et non invéniens,</l><l xml:id="m-09afe93f-66d6-4093-984a-a4f92d7b2229" facs="#m-7ed7b534-2c7d-4c1b-b816-abd39d9d0e84" label="lyrics-like">vidit cogitatiónes eórum, dixit eis:</l><l xml:id="m-044d4499-077b-4d69-9558-35d55f84edeb" facs="#m-0a5dac9a-97cd-4369-be53-3583e0b8be4b" label="lyrics-like">dicit : Revértar in domum meam,</l><l xml:id="m-0b46549c-4cd7-4015-822c-5c115ae9c17a" facs="#m-e5304160-0f72-4dfb-82e7-9bd93e96bcaf" label="lyrics-like">unde exívi. Et cum vénerit, invenit</l><l xml:id="m-602d5d8e-d9a5-4031-b1df-03ae6f2ada64" facs="#m-f7096b6c-3bea-4505-98e3-ab55f360edf1" label="lyrics-like">Omne regnum in sespsum divísum</l><l xml:id="m-0722db43-042d-4571-8e7f-ea55ecde1e39" facs="#m-a1d7da95-3070-4435-bc10-34d4a818d4d1" label="lyrics-like">desolábitur, et domus supra domum</l><l xml:id="m-4f5b93c9-c598-4d73-97b3-9f05116670db" facs="#m-c561bf81-925a-44ce-af4d-35b89515d0a1" label="lyrics-like">eam scopis mundátam, et ornátam.</l><l xml:id="m-cadda6c0-6832-4708-ba8c-ced455142b99" facs="#m-da732c18-8a09-4e6c-8c46-ec9faa8d8780" label="lyrics-like">cadet. Si autem et sátanas in se¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a91c2b1-a990-4916-92e7-d80f65895143" facs="#m-87d78c66-813e-4ac0-a8de-cd456f0816ef" label="lyrics-like">Tunc vadit, et assúmit septem álios</l><l xml:id="m-5d131f4e-cd14-409d-8ae3-f4bf3d4eb9e5" facs="#m-db40c243-d138-4177-8382-ee7f27f68ea2" label="lyrics-like">spiritus secum nequióres se, et in¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c87aa4f-bde2-473f-b685-c40bcb5cdeed" facs="#m-ef6f306f-1dc0-4bd5-b5dc-a0bae8fc33ea" label="lyrics-like">Ipsum divísus est, quómodo stabit</l><l xml:id="m-f23d9817-eec0-4073-8fd9-d7c5ac1ab73a" facs="#m-c9560d71-98b3-4652-9bff-18f557cafe69" label="lyrics-like">gréssi hábitant ibi. Et fiunt novis¬</l><l xml:id="m-54e57f21-d59c-46a2-b150-2aa8dc995a5e" facs="#m-f3d16a7d-8bcf-4b0a-9d89-4119ece00e37" label="lyrics-like">regnum ejus? quia dicitis in Beél¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec57823f-bf12-42ec-b250-175ef7b991ee" facs="#m-0d5d32b2-d9b0-4822-8099-97803a514a31" label="lyrics-like">sima hóminis illius peióra prióribus.</l><l xml:id="m-2a7be347-0245-4061-bc1d-7d1f1e9d7e72" facs="#m-a57988c9-745f-41f1-acc5-c7edbf03dedb" label="lyrics-like">zebub me eiicere daemónia. Si au¬</l><l xml:id="m-fcb37f66-fb6c-4c6a-b4b1-f60bf11e76ca" facs="#m-fbc9e502-40df-469c-985f-506e61daa994" label="lyrics-like">Factum est autem, cum haec díce¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5f3c218-920c-412b-9b76-86d63e59d310" facs="#m-eca3fc51-2856-463e-b4a3-7b13eeef47aa" label="lyrics-like">tem ego in Beélzebub ejicio daemó¬</l><l xml:id="m-997cab4d-7b6c-488c-ae95-e1733a9f7437" facs="#m-234908a5-62f5-44ad-b197-c25ed9ec1fcd" label="ambiguous">nia: fllii vestri in quo ejiciunt?</l><l xml:id="m-b1df8c13-b50e-4f61-aaa2-b05eb667039f" facs="#m-d9c0d4de-542d-4ac8-854d-8e5d8a4177e7" label="lyrics-like">ret: extóllens vocem quaedam mú¬</l><l xml:id="m-baee6534-7bf1-4a3e-8efb-0c52c74a9a98" facs="#m-b0a50cab-417c-425c-80e2-7c7f9f78ce6e" label="lyrics-like">lier de turba, dixit illi: Beátus ven¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c39b183-7a72-4ce1-9b2f-8f7e12ff799b" facs="#m-c31845cb-315f-4191-921c-be3522ca0080" label="lyrics-like">Ideo ipsi júdices vestri erunt. Porro</l><l xml:id="m-146856f4-7622-4551-a039-4a06b44a73e9" facs="#m-a3422cb4-09a8-4c5f-ab29-5249dcd13121" label="lyrics-like">ter, qui te portávit, et úbera, quae</l><l xml:id="m-8a318762-d87c-411e-88a2-1bbafb5e1f36" facs="#m-22ce41af-21d1-4cc0-84a8-e88e2941aeae" label="lyrics-like">si in digito Dei ejicio daemónia:</l><l xml:id="m-d45114c3-fdff-41c9-9824-f4a9f3104657" facs="#m-b407b38f-0cd3-486e-9d2d-f929b2c75266" label="lyrics-like">suxísti. At ille dixit: Quinímmo</l><l xml:id="m-e14a9205-9c84-4788-8b7b-bbd21aceb42a" facs="#m-db170be0-2843-46b3-8b12-4ca2a022a6ee" label="lyrics-like">profécto pervénit in vos regnum</l><l xml:id="m-34fb8a11-1d77-4e57-9c2c-37f1fad0af5f" facs="#m-151413f7-fea4-4258-8c72-1f14751a8687" label="lyrics-like">beáti, qui áudiunt verbum Dei, et</l><l xml:id="m-01c19b0b-89fa-444a-96ab-a926efb9c5b9" facs="#m-2d5616f4-4cfb-426a-a083-17ad2ea0d4ab" label="lyrics-like">Dei. Cum fortis armátus custódit</l><l xml:id="m-a50edae7-4de0-44c5-b0da-b60aa04d708b" facs="#m-6eaa52c2-b5fc-460a-bb9b-0431bac7d420" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-a7126254-34b6-4cff-81a1-33caf724bf75" facs="#m-85fee3c6-ef9a-4891-999d-93fd66bd3982" label="lyrics-like">átrium suum, in pace sunt ea quae custódiunt illud.</l><l xml:id="m-0416bae3-49eb-41a1-b138-eae1bf8ffe44" facs="#m-9c1c5391-e186-4b1c-9895-69a01ef1a23b" label="ambiguous">ofrert.?</l><l xml:id="m-aed9e699-f75f-4bd0-aea5-c7be6626ed37" facs="#m-da9330f9-bd49-4536-9d59-10dc16de35a0" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-afccbe4b-3f65-49c1-a311-8e682d1a776a" facs="#m-475314f0-1689-49b1-950f-6a7edb363cd0" label="lyrics-like">dUstí-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4c33066-2808-41f1-9bf4-91d0b9858cce" facs="#m-a0e803f2-486f-40ee-863f-7b50e1f7e22c" label="lyrics-like">Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-dba3236f-b680-41b8-b0a9-6a800c1c5ec9" facs="#m-174a3469-d5ba-4a8f-8b28-8313c8ff96f7" label="ambiguous">lae¬</l><l xml:id="m-90c8ac4b-9713-44a4-aeef-296452e4ce51" facs="#m-6c52a73a-1f7a-43c6-b8c8-dc9ef39f68ac" label="lyrics-like">ni -ré- ctae,</l><l xml:id="m-1cb82883-1d33-4209-b269-4be428160994" facs="#m-06f50e37-9736-4d08-ab08-859f9f867b92" label="ambiguous">et dulci¬</l><l xml:id="m-daff1f13-cf39-439a-92b8-e8ac848af6bb" facs="#m-55985a35-7f0d-4dcd-9c65-b235b6824419" label="lyrics-like">ficántes cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-a748a9d1-236e-49d4-9cc4-f421742bedb3" facs="#m-6ecc6830-c0aa-49a6-8fc0-bfd71c6355f2" label="ambiguous">ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-b79983ce-cc80-4cc8-b023-3d86a0ed4204" facs="#m-5b5d09f9-b986-4dd8-ac0b-e7c457171d7b" label="ambiguous">da,</l><l xml:id="m-3a27e9d6-3659-4b64-8c8a-706b1b328154" facs="#m-8f691dd6-9724-4900-8afa-1588cf67c19f" label="ambiguous">ra</l><l xml:id="m-17ae5be5-ddcb-4ff6-ba4f-1526e9f9a574" facs="#m-b77be683-e3b7-4088-984b-ba366f6a3409" label="ambiguous">super</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>